WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.820
Two friends sit together in a gurdwara.

2
00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.480
Both are Sikhs.

3
00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:08.280
One wears a steel bangle, a
small wooden comb in her hair,

4
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.550
and a sword.

5
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.660
The other wears none of them.

6
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.380
Anandpur, 1699.

7
00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:19.560
Guru Gobind Singh asks a great crowd:
who will give their head for the faith?

8
00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:23.190
Five people step forward, one by one.

9
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:28.060
So if two people are both Sikhs, why
might only one of them wear a bangle,

10
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.090
a comb and a sword?

11
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.000
In this mission, you'll unpack 5 objects,

12
00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.690
each with its own meaning.

13
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:38.420
Then you'll follow the amrit
ceremony, step by step.

14
00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:43.000
Your mission: find out why only one
of two Sikhs might wear a bangle,

15
00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.590
a comb and a sword.
